{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>זאת, חטאת</b> — punishment, like 'the punishment of Sodom' (מחטאת סדום)." "<b>וחטאת כל הגוים</b> — that they have rivers to water their soil, yet they will not be saved from the plague. I myself have seen lands like this."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:06.503361593Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}